Subject: [PATCH 40/42] Voltorb on Route 38 too

Route 37's Voltorb is 4-5% by morning and day but 1% at night. This adds it
to Route 38 at 10% at every time of day, Lv. 28, in one of Raticate's two
slots (Raticate 30% -> 20%). Made by tools/hack/voltorb_wild.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEYSk2h6k1E1jWo3cHd
